      "message": "Should key creation and encryption operation be restricted when device is locked ? I thought we wanted to restrict only decrypt operations or possibly signature ?\n\nIf key creation and encryption is restricted then applications wouldnt be able to use keyguard bound keys to protect any data that is downloaded (e.g. email) when the device is locked ?",
